<title>PHILIPPINES: Petron says 9-mth net 2.7 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Petron says 9-mth net 2.7 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>		   (in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Sales				   39.1 vs 33.818</p>
<p>    Net income			    2.7  vs 1.979</p>
<p>Note: Full name Petron Corporation. The company said higher sales volume and better margins boosted its income. Volume of petroleum products sold went up to 43.8 million barrels from 41.6 million barrels in the same 1995 period.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8936 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
